== Asciidoctor PDF 2.3.27 (MIT)

Copyright (C) 2014-present OpenDevise Inc. and the Asciidoctor Project.
https://github.com/asciidoctor/asciidoctor-pdf

* The conversion is a port of Asciidoctor PDF's converter and theme loader.
* theme/bundled.mbt holds the text of its bundled themes (data/themes/*.yml).
* fonts/data_fa_legacy_mapping_yml.mbt holds its mapping of Font Awesome 4
  icon names (data/fonts/fa-legacy-mapping.yml).
* theme/harvest_test.mbt and theme/testdata are derived from its test suite
  (spec/theme_loader_spec.rb and its fixtures); tests/images holds images
  copied from its spec/fixtures.

